    "How to get the real file:",
    "  1. Firebase Console > Project settings > Your apps > Add app > Android.",
    "  2. Use package name com.pravaswataghati.app (must match applicationId in",
    "     android/app/build.gradle and appId in capacitor.config.ts).",
    "  3. Download google-services.json and drop it next to this file, at",
    "     android/app/google-services.json.",
    "  4. Run `npm run cap:sync`, then rebuild.",
    "",
    "The real file is gitignored. Without it, android/app/build.gradle skips the",
    "google-services plugin and the app still builds - push notifications just stay",
    "inactive. Add the SHA-1/SHA-256 of your signing keys in the console too, or",
    "Google Sign-In will fail on release builds."
